OL,3,AHigh voter turnout for Israel election
OL,4,Awith less than one hour until polls due
OL,5,Ato close
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere's been very high turnout in
OL,8,FIsrael's pivotal general election, with
OL,9,Fvoting due close in less than one hour
OL,11,FPolls are due to close at 22:00 local
OL,12,Ftime (20:00 GMT) - but those already in
OL,13,Fline will still be able to vote
OL,15,FIt is Israel's first legislative
OL,16,Felection since the Hamas-led attacks on
OL,17,F7 October 2023. All 120 seats in the
OL,18,FKnesset, Israel's parliament, are up
OL,19,Ffor grabs
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
