OL,3,AHigh voter turnout for Israel election
OL,4,Awith less than one hour until polls due
OL,5,Ato close
OL,6,
OL,7,FA party must hold 61 to have a
OL,8,Fmajority, but this has never happened
OL,9,Fin the country's history and
OL,10,Fgovernments are typically made up of
OL,11,Fcoalitions
OL,13,FIsraeli exit polls are expected as soon
OL,14,Fas polls close, with preliminary
OL,15,Fresults expected on Wednesday -
OL,16,Fofficial results are scheduled to be
OL,17,Fpublished at the start of November
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
