OL,5,Ato close
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolling released on Friday suggests
OL,8,Fincumbent Benjamin Netanyahu is almost
OL,9,Fneck-and-neck with former military
OL,10,Fchief Gadi Eisenkot in the race to
OL,11,Fbecome prime minister
